1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:03,137
Unicorn ternyata pernah
"ditemukan" di Sumatra...

2
00:00:03,137 --> 00:00:05,927
tapi wujud aslinya mengecewakan!

3
00:00:05,927 --> 00:00:07,434
Marco Polo menggambarkannya:

4
00:00:07,434 --> 00:00:09,007
hampir sebesar gajah,

5
00:00:09,007 --> 00:00:10,581
bulunya seperti kerbau,

6
00:00:10,581 --> 00:00:12,032
1 cula di dahi.

7
00:00:12,032 --> 00:00:13,333
Katanya jelek,

8
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,607
suka berkubang lumpur,

9
00:00:14,607 --> 00:00:16,461
sama sekali tidak mirip dongeng!

10
00:00:16,461 --> 00:00:17,191
Jadi,

11
00:00:17,191 --> 00:00:18,399
apa yang ia lihat?

12
00:00:18,399 --> 00:00:19,822
Para ahli yakin:

13
00:00:19,822 --> 00:00:20,946
badak Sumatra,

14
00:00:20,946 --> 00:00:22,566
badak paling berbulu!

15
00:00:22,566 --> 00:00:24,363
Kini tinggal puluhan ekor...

16
00:00:24,363 --> 00:00:25,375
tapi tahun ini,

17
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:27,060
2 induknya sedang hamil!

18
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:27,687
Follow,

19
00:00:27,687 --> 00:00:29,985
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
